---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ArticleHero from '../components/ArticleHero.astro';
const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Article',
  headline: 'Sola Salon Studios Near Me: How to Find One',
};
---
<Layout
  title="Sola Salon Studios Near Me: How to Find One"
  description="Practical, privacy-respecting ways to find a salon studio near you, including manual city or ZIP code search."
  canonicalPath="/sola-salon-studios-near-me/"
  schema={schema}
>
  <ArticleHero eyebrow="Locator" title="Sola Salon Studios Near Me" image="/images/gallery/gallery-blonde-waves-2.jpg" imageAlt="Client with a finished hairstyle" />
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <p class="text-xs text-ink/50 mb-2"><a href="/" class="hover:underline">Home</a> / Sola Salon Studios Near Me</p>

    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-8">
      We don't run a private location database, but here's a fast, privacy-friendly
      way to search on your own terms — either by typing your city/ZIP code, or by
      sharing your location with your browser only if you choose to.
    </p>

    <div class="border border-sand rounded-xl2 bg-white p-6 mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Search by City or ZIP Code</h2>
      <form id="near-me-form" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
        <label for="location-input" class="sr-only">City or ZIP code</label>
        <input
          id="location-input"
          type="text"
          placeholder="e.g. Austin, TX or 78701"
          class="flex-1 rounded-lg border border-sand px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-400"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="rounded-lg bg-rose-500 text-white font-medium px-6 py-3 hover:bg-rose-600 transition-colors">
          Search
        </button>
      </form>

      <button
        id="use-location-btn"
        type="button"
        class="mt-4 text-sm text-rose-600 underline"
      >
        Or use my current location instead
      </button>
      <p class="text-xs text-ink/50 mt-2">
        We'll only access your location if you click the button above and approve
        your browser's permission prompt. Nothing is stored on our end — the search
        happens entirely in your browser.
      </p>
      <p id="near-me-result" class="text-sm mt-4"></p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Tips for a Better Search</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-ink/80 mb-8">
      <li>Search "salon studios near [your city]" alongside the specific service you want.</li>
      <li>Check individual stylists' social media for portfolio photos before booking.</li>
      <li>Call or message ahead to confirm current pricing and availability.</li>
      <li>Read our <a href="/sola-salon-studio/" class="text-rose-600 underline">salon studio guide</a> so you know what questions to ask.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">What to Check Once You've Found a Few Options</h2>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      A map search will show you locations, but it won't tell you much about the
      individual professionals working there. Once you've narrowed down a
      building or two, the next step is researching who actually works in that
      location — most independent stylists maintain their own Instagram or
      booking page separate from the location's general listing. Look specifically
      for recent work in the style or technique you want, rather than judging
      based on the location's overall star rating, which blends reviews for many
      different professionals.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Booking Your First Appointment</h2>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Most independent professionals in the salon-studio model handle their own
      booking, often through a texting service, an online booking page, or a
      direct phone call rather than a shared front desk. When you reach out for
      the first time, it helps to be specific: mention the service you want, roughly
      how long your hair is, and any reference photos you have. This lets the
      professional give you an accurate time estimate and price range before you
      even arrive, rather than discovering a mismatch once you're in the chair.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">What If There Isn't One Nearby?</h2>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Salon-suite locations aren't in every city, and even where they exist,
      availability for a specific service or specialty can be limited. If a search
      doesn't turn up a good match, broadening your radius slightly, checking
      neighboring towns, or searching for the service itself ("balayage near me")
      rather than the business model by name often surfaces more options. A great
      independent stylist working outside the salon-studio model can be just as
      good a fit as one working inside it — the model itself is a business
      structure, not a guarantee of quality.
    </p>

    <p class="text-xs text-ink/50 border-t border-sand pt-4">
      Independent informational resource. Not affiliated with, sponsored by, or
      endorsed by Sola Salon Studios. Search results link to third-party map
      providers; we do not maintain our own location directory.
    </p>
  </article>

  <script>
    const form = document.getElementById('near-me-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
    const input = document.getElementById('location-input') as HTMLInputElement | null;
    const result = document.getElementById('near-me-result');
    const useLocationBtn = document.getElementById('use-location-btn');

    function openMapSearch(query: string) {
      const url = `https://www.google.com/maps/search/${encodeURIComponent('salon studios near ' + query)}`;
      window.open(url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
    }

    form?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const value = input?.value.trim();
      if (!value) {
        if (result) result.textContent = 'Please enter a city or ZIP code.';
        return;
      }
      if (result) result.textContent = `Opening a map search for "${value}"…`;
      openMapSearch(value);
    });

    useLocationBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!navigator.geolocation) {
        if (result) result.textContent = 'Geolocation is not supported in this browser.';
        return;
      }
      navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(
        (pos) => {
          const { latitude, longitude } = pos.coords;
          const url = `https://www.google.com/maps/search/salon+studios/@${latitude},${longitude},13z`;
          if (result) result.textContent = 'Opening a map search near your current location…';
          window.open(url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
        },
        () => {
          if (result) result.textContent = 'Location permission was denied. You can still search by city or ZIP above.';
        }
      );
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
